SUMMARY:Alliance Francaise:  Duo Perse-Inca  ($20)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nWe'll kick off our season with **Allia
 nce Francaise**--with a wonderful concert on a Saturday night!!\n\nWe've b
 een very fortunate to see **Duo Perse-Inca** 2X before.\n\nOnce in Toronto
 . Once in Montreal.\n\nSounds from Iran\, mixed with sounds from Peru. Ins
 truments and artists--they communicate with each other so well!\n\n***Tick
 et link is below***: $20 (general admission)\n\nWe love the **Alliance Fra
 ncaise** space (music\, theatre\, film\, art)\n\n**A World Music Concert--
 **\n\n**Duo Perse-Inca returns** to Alliance Française Toronto nearly fou
 r years after their acclaimed Spadina Theatre performance.\n\n**Showan Tav
 akol and Federico Tarazona - rooted respectively in the musical traditions
  of Iran and Peru** \\- have built a repertoire that moves seamlessly betw
 een improvisation and co\\-composition\\\, setting the Iranian kamancheh a
 nd the Andean charango in genuine dialogue\\.\n\nTheir album *Echoes of th
 e Mountains* charts a journey across continents and through the ages\, del
 ivered with mastery and warmth.\n\n**More info and sounds:**\n\nhttps://ce
 ntredesmusiciensdumonde.com/en/portfolio/duo-perse-inca_en/\n\n**TICKET li
 nk for September 26th**--(will SELL-OUT)\n\nhttps://www.alliance-francaise
 .ca/en/art/cultural-season/concerts/311-duo-perse-inca
