SUMMARY:Arts and Culture Social Mixer
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nI am hosting a social drinks night for
  GTA Art lovers\, business professionals and entrepreneurs to mingle and c
 onnect.\n\nOur event will be inside Mister C Bar Room @ The Bisha Hotel To
 ronto\n\nEnter the hotel lobby from the front doors of the Bisha Hotel\, M
 ister C\nBar Room is on your left inside the hotel lobby.\n\nStyle Code: B
 usiness Casual/Upscale Trendy.\n\nCome out and socialize with other GTA Ar
 t lovers\, business professionals and entrepreneurs over drinks!\n\nWe hav
 e over 7 meetup groups invited to this event so this won't be a small crow
 d.\n\nRemember to bring your business cards as this is a networking event.
 \n\nThis event is FREE to attend\, food and drinks are at your own cost.\n
 \nPlease purchase 1 drink to support the venue.\n\nWe will have name tags 
 for everyone and encourage people to mingle.\n\n\\*\\*\\* FREE BUSINESS CA
 RD RAFFLE DRAW - PRIZE $20.00 LCBO GIFT CARD. \\*\\*\\*\n\nPlease follow u
 s:\n\nFacebook/TikTok @TorontoSocialMixer\nTwitter/Instagram: @TOSocialMix
 er\nWhatsApp Channel: Toronto Social Mixer\n\nInvite your facebook friends
  to our events.
