SUMMARY:Soundstreams presents Steve Reich at 90!
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\n**Soundstreams** exists to strengthen 
 public engagement with new Canadian music and music theatre/opera through 
 commissioning\, developing\, producing\, and disseminating that music. We 
 aim to inspire\, foster\, and enable excellence at the highest internation
 al standards.\n\nLet's enjoy the season opening concert!!\n\nOct. 6\, 2026
 \, 7:30pm\, Koerner Hall.\nIn collaboration with Faculty of Music\, Univer
 sity of Toronto\n\nhttps://stevereich.com/\n\n**Steve Reich** has been des
 cribed as “our greatest living composer” (NY Times). We celebrate his 
 90th birthday with the North American premiere of *In All Your Ways* for 1
 4 instruments\, co-commissioned by Soundstreams\, Carnegie Hall\, Edinburg
 h Festival\, Philharmonie de Paris and others.\n\nThe program includes two
  legendary signature masterpieces: *Music for 18 Musicians* and *Clapping 
 Music*\, all performed by some of the world’s greatest interpreters of h
 is music. *Clapping Music* features an exclusive screening with Reich perf
 orming one of the parts on film and **Russell Hartenberger** performing th
 e other live on stage.\n\n***Ticket link/More info here: ($35-$95)***\n\nh
 ttps://soundstreams.ca/events/celebrating-steve-reich-at-90/\n\nhttps://ww
 w.rcmusic.com/concert/soundstreams-presents-steve-reich-at-90-455401\n\nht
 tps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steve_Reich\n\nDon't miss out on this concert 
 experience...I'm sitting in the Lower Balcony.
